  "body": "Hi,\r\nI am proposing a feature where developer console cannot be used to debug a website as it is a production stage. Due to this inclusion, it will be very difficult to debug any web application when it is being served. I feel it can be done using CSP by adding a flag like others.\r\n\r\nProposal Gist:\r\nContent-Security-Policy has to contain no-developer-console as an option to show no way to access site internals using developer console. During development its non inclusion can allow developer console to debug the website",
